<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Friday 104,000-USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Friday 104,000-USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said Friday's actual receipts 104,000 and Saturday's 18,000 head at interior Iowa/so. Minnesta. Opening trade was not well established. Early sales of barrows and gilts were steady to $0.50 higher than the mid-session Friday. Top $52.50 per cwt.</p>
<p>			   Couuntry		   Plants</p>
<p>US 1-3   46-49% Carcass Base Lean*</p>
<p>220-260 lbs	    50.00 -51.00	   51.00 -52.00</p>
<p>few			49.50  51.50	   50.50  52.50</p>
<p>Sows - uneven, generally steady. Top $48.00. US 1-3 300-450 lbs.  39.50 -41.00	   40.00 -42.00</p>
<p>450-500 lbs.	   41.00 -44.00	   42.00 -44.00</p>
<p>500 lbs. up	    44.00 -47.00	   44.00 -48.00</p>
